## WHY
Some tools require provider data. Keeping credentials account-scoped prevents members from sharing keys and lets the server enforce secure use.

## WHEN
Add a connection only when a tool requires that provider or when you want to test provider-backed market data.

## HOW
1. Open Dashboard → Settings → Connections & API Keys.
2. Enter the token. You may Show/Hide it while typing.
3. Test the connection before saving.
4. Save it. After saving, the platform displays only a masked representation.
5. Replace or remove the credential from the same Settings section.

## SECURITY
Never post an API key in Market Commons, Support screenshots, or a public message. Staff should not ask for the full saved secret. If a key is exposed, rotate it with the provider and replace the saved credential.','published',true,false,true,'V0133_DATA_CONNECTIONS',0,0,now())
